@cc [owner:fabiencelier,label:product;mcp] changes-are-suggestions
Tools of the `building_agents_and_skills` MCP server MUST NOT modify an agent or a skill directly.
Each tool records a `pending` agent or skill suggestion with source `conversational` for the
editors to review, marks conflicting pending suggestions `outdated`, and returns the suggestion
`sId` embedded in a directive (`:agent_suggestion[]{sId=... kind=...}` or
`:skill_suggestion[]{sId=... kind=...}`) so the conversation UI can render it inline.
